.claude/

# ─── Local agent / editor tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal assistant configuration. Useful on one machine, noise in the repo
# listing for everyone else.
.agents/
.serena/

# .cursor is now ignored in full, including rules/.
#
# NOTE ON WHAT THIS COSTS: .cursor/rules/no-cursor-attribution.mdc was the
# shared rule that keeps AI co-author trailers out of commit messages. It is no
# longer distributed with the repo. The .githooks/ scripts still strip those
# trailers, but only for a clone that has run:
#     git config core.hooksPath .githooks
# To share the rule again, delete the line below and restore `!.cursor/rules/`.
.cursor/

# ─── Run artifacts (generated, not source) ───────────────────────────────────
# Screenshots and page captures produced by analysis runs. These are outputs of
# a scan, regenerated on every run, and they are what makes the repo heavy.
#
# Scoped deliberately rather than ignoring "*.png": frontend/logo/ holds the
# three real Sudarshan brand assets and must stay tracked.
artifacts_qa/
tests/apks/validation_runs/
**/sudarshan_artifacts/

